[=#intro]
== Introduction ==

The [../classes/html/classsys.html sys class] provides methods for getting information about the operating system and controlling the state of the operating system.


[=#info]
== Getting System Information ==

In this example, various bits of system information are printed out.

{{{#!blockquote
{{{#!code
@../../examples/sys.cpp@
}}}
}}}

Note that not all systems support every piece of information.  If a piece of information is unsupported, then a -1 is returned.


[=#reboot]
== Reboot ==

This example reboots the system, when run as root or Administrator.

{{{#!blockquote
{{{#!code
@../../examples/reboot.cpp@
}}}
}}}


[=#shutdown]
== Shutdown ==

